01:18:43.840 --> 01:18:45.100
Right, wow.

1827
01:18:45.100 --> 01:18:50.100
And so each plant has a story like that.

1828
01:18:50.630 --> 01:18:53.010
Each plant has something positive

1829
01:18:53.010 --> 01:18:55.440
that it wants to bring to your health.

1830
01:18:55.440 --> 01:18:59.120
Every single one wants to bring something to your health.

